---
fmContentType: glossaryEntry
term: "Dispensary"
letter: "D"
anchor: "dispensary"
category: "general"
---

A licensed retail outlet selling cannabis and cannabis products. Dispensaries operate under state cannabis laws and typically carry flower, pre-rolls, edibles, concentrates, tinctures, topicals, and accessories. Quality dispensaries provide lab-tested products with cannabinoid and terpene information, knowledgeable staff, and COAs on request.
